3–6. Reproduce → root cause (не mask) → regression red → fix → green
6b. **Scenario:** user-visible UI → Playwright targeted **обязателен** (не только Vitest); **parent** runs
7. §0.11 если refs; заполни bugfix-файл; scenario path в Handoff
8. Pre-FINISH skills
9. **FINISH:** @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-block.mdc (`code_changed: yes`) → FRONT QA (new chat)
   - FAIL: без scenario; Handoff «manual smoke only»
   - FAIL: visible UI без design stack

**Верификация**: root cause + TDD + scenario + FINISH + graphify
